---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "GLASS NEURONS · The Black Box Isn't Black"
	: "黑盒不黑 · GLASS NEURONS";
const description = isEn
	? "On 15 October 2026, Nick Cammarata published 'Neural Networks Are Already Clean,' arguing AI's black box was never as tangled as we thought — roughly 90% of neuron poles have one primary job. This interactive page lets you look inside with a toy neuron lab."
	: "2026 年 10 月 15 日，Goodfire 研究员 Nick Cammarata 发表 2.6 万字长文《神经网络本已纯净》，提出 AI 黑盒并不黑：现代模型中约 90% 的神经元极向从始至终只有一项清晰的主任务。本页构建了互动玩具神经元实验室，带你直观检视这一震撼 AI 可解释性领域的学术争论。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#040814] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-emerald-500/30 selection:text-emerald-200">
			<!-- Ambient Neural Energy Glows -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#10b981_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-36 -left-36 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-16 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>NICK CAMMARATA · GOODFIRE · 2026-10-15</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>🔬</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">论文：神经网络本已纯净 (2.6万字 / 65分钟)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Essay: Neural Networks Are Already Clean (26k words)</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>💡</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">初步审计标的：Qwen3-32B 语言模型</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Preliminary Audit: Qwen3-32B (Alibaba)</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- In-Page Language Switcher -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">
							<span class="lang-zh">AI 可解释性前沿争议 · 2026-10</span>
							<span class="lang-en">AI Interpretability Debate · Oct 2026</span>
						</div>
						<a
							id="inpage-lang-toggle"
							href={isEn ? "/projects/glass-neurons/" : "/en/projects/glass-neurons/"}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-emerald-950/60 font-mono text-xs transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
							title={isEn ? "切换为中文" : "Switch to English"}
						>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
								<path d="m12.87 15.07-2.54-2.51.03-.03A17.52 17.52 0 0 0 14.07 6H17V4h-7V2H8v2H1v2h11.17C11.5 7.92 10.44 9.75 9 11.35 8.07 10.32 7.3 9.19 6.69 8h-2c.73 1.63 1.73 3.17 2.98 4.56l-5.09 5.02L4 19l5-5 3.11 3.11.76-2.04zM18.5 10h-2L12 22h2l1.12-3h4.75L21 22h2l-4.5-12zm-2.62 7 1.62-4.33L19.12 17h-3.24z"/>
							</svg>
							<span class="lang-zh font-bold">English</span>
							<span class="lang-en font-bold">中文</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">黑盒不黑 · GLASS NEURONS</span>
					<span class="lang-en">GLASS NEURONS · The Black Box Isn't Black</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">“黑盒其实并不黑——前提是你得用正确的方法去看它。”</span>
					<span class="lang-en">"The black box isn't black — you just have to look at it properly."</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							<strong>2026 年 10 月 15 日</strong>，AI 可解释性初创公司 Goodfire 研究员（前 OpenAI 核心成员）<strong>Nick Cammarata</strong> 发表了长达 26,000 字（阅读时长约 65 分钟）的长文<strong>《神经网络本已纯净》（Neural Networks Are Already Clean）</strong>。文章在发布数小时内引爆 Hacker News 与 LessWrong 首页，引发了整个 AI 研究界的激烈震荡与两极评价。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							On <strong>15 October 2026</strong>, <strong>Nick Cammarata</strong> — interpretability researcher at AI startup Goodfire and formerly with OpenAI — published a landmark 26,000-word essay (a 65-minute read) titled <strong>"Neural Networks Are Already Clean"</strong>. It vaulted to the front page of Hacker News and LessWrong within hours, igniting intense debate across the machine learning community.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							过去十年，学术界普遍悲观地认为神经网络是一个无可救药的“混沌黑盒”：单个神经元似乎同时被多个互不相干的现实概念激活（即“多语义性”与“叠加假说”）。然而 Cammarata 在对阿里巴巴开源大模型 <strong>Qwen3-32B</strong> 展开的深度审计中发现：多达 <strong>约 90% 的神经元极向（Poles）其实只有一项清晰的主要任务</strong>；约 7% 拥有两项相关的延伸任务；仅有约 2-4% 尚未被完全理解。所谓的“混乱”，很大程度上只是过去的探查工具与过时架构投下的幻影。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							For over a decade, researchers feared neural networks were intrinsically chaotic black boxes, where individual neurons simultaneously represent wildly unrelated concepts (polysemanticity and superposition). In preliminary audits of Alibaba's open-source <strong>Qwen3-32B</strong> model, Goodfire estimates that roughly <strong>90% of neuron poles have ONE primary job</strong> (often with minor related offshoots); ~7% have two related jobs; and only ~2-4% remain not yet understood. Much of the field's supposed mess was an artifact of dated architectures and clumsy tools.
						</span>
					</p>
					<div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-300 font-mono text-xs">
						<span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold block mb-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">论文开篇原话 · OPENING LINE:</span>
							<span class="lang-en">VERBATIM OPENING LINE:</span>
						</span>
						<p class="italic text-slate-200">
							"I think I have good news about the nature of neural networks."
						</p>
						<p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">（“我想，我关于神经网络本质的好消息要带给大家。”）</span>
							<span class="lang-en">— Nick Cammarata, 15 October 2026</span>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- 6-METRIC OVERVIEW STRIP -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
					<span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
						<span class="lang-zh">核心审计指标 · BENCHMARK AUDIT STRIP</span>
						<span class="lang-en">BENCHMARK AUDIT METRICS STRIP</span>
					</span>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3 text-xs font-mono">
					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">2023 旧结论</span>
							<span class="lang-en">2023 OLD VERDICT</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-rose-400 mt-1">~1.7%</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">OpenAI 项目可解释神经元</span>
							<span class="lang-en">OpenAI project legible rate</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-emerald-500/30">
						<div class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">2026 单任务率</span>
							<span class="lang-en">2026 SINGLE JOB</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-emerald-300 mt-1">~90%</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">Qwen3-32B 极向主任务</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Qwen3-32B poles with 1 job</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-cyan-500/30">
						<div class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">双重相关任务</span>
							<span class="lang-en">DUAL RELATED</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-cyan-300 mt-1">~7%</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">递归泛化自然分支</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Recursive generalization</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-amber-500/30">
						<div class="text-amber-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">未理解比例</span>
							<span class="lang-en">UNUNDERSTOOD</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-amber-300 mt-1">~2-4%</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">待后续深入假说检验</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Working hypothesis gap</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-purple-500/30">
						<div class="text-purple-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">现代重训末层</span>
							<span class="lang-en">MODERN RETRAIN</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-purple-300 mt-1">99-100%</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">跨 300 倍规模极易理解</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Legible across 300x scale</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-slate-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">长文篇幅</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ESSAY SCALE</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-white mt-1">26,000 字</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">65 分钟深度论文长读</span>
							<span class="lang-en">65-min comprehensive essay</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- REALITY CHECK & HONESTY STRIP (CLEARLY MARKED) -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-950/20 border border-amber-500/40 text-slate-200">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-amber-400 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
					<span>⚖️</span>
					<span class="lang-zh">现实审视与科学诚实性声明 (REALITY CHECK)</span>
					<span class="lang-en">REALITY CHECK & SCIENTIFIC HONESTY STRIP</span>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/20">
						<div class="text-amber-300 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>⚠️</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">1. 90% 数据仅为初步审计估算，并非既成科学定律</span>
							<span class="lang-en">1. 90% Is a Preliminary Audit Estimate, Not a Proven Law</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								Cammarata 本人在论文中明确将这一主张界定为<strong>“工作假说（working hypothesis）”</strong>，其第四步推导更被作者本人亲自标为<strong>“高度投机性（highly speculative）”</strong>。切勿将初步抽样推论误当作盖棺定论的物理铁律。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								The 90% figure is a preliminary audit estimate, not a proven law; the essay itself frames the claim as a working hypothesis (its fourth step is labeled "highly speculative" by Cammarata himself).
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/20">
						<div class="text-amber-300 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>⚠️</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">2. 外部独立学者尚未完成复现</span>
							<span class="lang-en">2. Outside Researchers Have Not Yet Reproduced Audits</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								截至 2026 年 10 月中旬（17-22日），<strong>尚无任何外部独立实验室或同行评议团队完整复现这一审计数据</strong>；与之配套的技术支持论文（Technical Companion Paper）目前仍未正式公开发布。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Outside researchers have NOT yet reproduced the audits (as of ~17 Oct, no outsider had reproduced any of it); the technical companion paper is still unreleased.
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/20">
						<div class="text-amber-300 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>⚖️</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">3. 学界顶尖专家阵营依然深度割裂</span>
							<span class="lang-en">3. Top Researchers Are Deeply Split</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								Google DeepMind 的机械可解释性领军人物 <strong>Neel Nanda 依然坚信叠加假说（Superposition）在深层网络中真实存在</strong>；有学者称该长文可能是该领域的“里程碑式转折点”，亦有顶尖学者评价其为“有用但并非颠覆性突破”。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Google DeepMind's Neel Nanda still thinks superposition is real; top researchers are split (one calls it a possible turning point, another says useful but not a big change).
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/20">
						<div class="text-amber-300 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>💼</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">4. 商业利益相关性：Goodfire 制造并出售显微镜</span>
							<span class="lang-en">4. Commercial Interest: Goodfire Sells the Microscopes</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								发布方 Goodfire 是一家商业化 AI 可解释性初创企业，其商业模式正是<strong>对外出售探查大模型内部状态的分析工具与服务</strong>。如果“神经网络可以被轻松看透”，其商业工具链的价值与落地门槛将获得巨大背书。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Goodfire sells tools for looking inside AI — it has a direct commercial interest in this clean-box narrative being true.
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/20">
						<div class="text-amber-300 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>🔮</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">5. 对高风险关键行为的预测力仍待严苛实证</span>
							<span class="lang-en">5. Predicting Consequential Behavior Remains Unproven</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								正如科技智库《The Neuron》所指出的：研究界仍需用实打实的证据证明，单神经元级别的标签化解释，是否真的能够<strong>精准预测并在事前干预先进大模型在现实世界中的关键复杂行为</strong>（如对抗攻击、欺骗、幻觉等）。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Researchers still need to show that neuron-level explanations can predict CONSEQUENTIAL behavior in advanced models (per The Neuron's coverage).
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-amber-500/20">
						<div class="text-amber-300 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>🎨</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">6. 本页所有演示神经元均为手写合成玩具演示</span>
							<span class="lang-en">6. Hand-Coded Synthetic Demos (Not Real Qwen Data)</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								本页面中包含的所有可交互神经元、网格与图表均为用于解释科学原理的<strong>手写合成玩具模型（toy synthetic demos）</strong>，它们<strong>绝非 Qwen3-32B 的真实神经元权重，也不是真实模型原始数据</strong>。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								All toy neurons on this page are hand-coded synthetic demos illustrating the IDEAS — they are NOT Qwen3-32B neurons and not real model data.
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- INTERACTIVE 01: 1.7% TO 90% JOURNEY & DONUT CHART -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
							<span>📊</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">交互实验 01 · 1.7% 到 90% 的认知跃迁</span>
							<span class="lang-en">INTERACTIVE 01 · FROM 1.7% TO 90%</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">从“不可解读的混沌”到“九成纯净的主任务”</span>
							<span class="lang-en">The Paradigm Shift: From 1.7% Noise to 90% Legibility</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<button
							id="btn-switch-2023"
							type="button"
							class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
						>
							<span class="lang-zh">2023 OpenAI 裁决 (~1.7%)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">2023 OpenAI Era (~1.7%)</span>
						</button>
						<button
							id="btn-switch-2026"
							type="button"
							class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono border border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-300 font-bold transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
						>
							<span class="lang-zh">2026 Goodfire 审计 (~90%)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">2026 Goodfire Audit (~90%)</span>
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
					<span class="lang-zh">
