						bodyEn: "The primary root role. At the token level, it fires for the character sequence 'iy' and English phonetic /iː/ endings like clarity, quality, simplify.",
						tokens: ["qual-<strong>iy</strong>", "clar-<strong>iy</strong>", "simpl-<strong>iy</strong>", "p-<strong>iy</strong>-ing"],
						takeawayZh: "单任务基准：此时神经元只关心字母与音素的形态组合。",
						takeawayEn: "Baseline single-job: focused purely on spelling and phonetic form."
